                    <a href="/en/wood-program" hreflang="en">Wood Program</a>
            </div>
        
                <h1>
  Kokoon Project Information</h1>
                                          <div class="aalto-article__ingress">
            
                    Kokoon is a modular living unit built to address the current housing situation in Finland. It was created by the Wood Program at Aalto University.
            
          </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>

          <div class="aalto-article__hero-wrap full-bleed-container full-bleed-container--hero">
        <div class="aalto-article__hero-container aalto-article__hero-container--default">
                    


<figure>
  <div class="">
    <div class="media-with-caption__container">
      
                    


  
      
